  "html": "<h2 id=\"concepts\">1. RTO &amp; RPO Fundamentals</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-01-rpo-and-rto.svg\" alt=\"RPO and RTO\" width=\"536\" height=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:536px;max-width:536px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"backup-restore\">2. Backup &amp; Restore</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-02-backup-and-restore-strategy.svg\" alt=\"Backup and restore strategy\" width=\"870\" height=\"372\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:870px\"></figure>\n\n  <h4>AWS Backup — Centralized Backup Management</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Centrally configure and manage backup policies across EC2, RDS, Aurora, EFS, FSx, DynamoDB, EBS, S3</li>\n    <li><strong>Backup Vault Lock:</strong> WORM (Write Once Read Many) — prevent backup deletion even by admin</li>\n    <li><strong>Cross-account backup:</strong> Copy backups to different account (immutable DR copy)</li>\n    <li><strong>Cross-region backup:</strong> Copy backups to different region</li>\n    <li>Integrates with Organizations for policy-driven backup across all accounts</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 id=\"pilot-light\">3. Pilot Light</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-03-pilot-light-dr-strategy.svg\" alt=\"Pilot light DR strategy\" width=\"783\" height=\"556\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:783px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"warm-standby\">4. Warm Standby</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-04-warm-standby-dr-strategy.svg\" alt=\"Warm standby DR strategy\" width=\"803\" height=\"593\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:803px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"active-passive\">5. Multi-Site Active/Passive</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-05-active-passive-multi-site.svg\" alt=\"Active/passive multi-site\" width=\"810\" height=\"578\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:810px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"active-active\">6. Multi-Site Active/Active</h2>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-06-active-active-multi-site.svg\" alt=\"Active/active multi-site\" width=\"923\" height=\"656\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:923px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"decision\">7. DR Strategy Decision Framework</h2>\n  <table>\n    <tbody><tr><th>Strategy</th><th>RTO</th><th>RPO</th><th>Cost</th><th>Complexity</th><th>When to Use</th></tr>\n    <tr><td>Backup &amp; Restore</td><td>Hours–Days</td><td>Hours</td><td>Lowest ($)</td><td>Low</td><td>Non-critical, dev/test, cost-sensitive</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Pilot Light</td><td>10min–1hr</td><td>Minutes</td><td>Low ($$)</td><td>Medium</td><td>Critical DBs, non-critical apps. RTO acceptable in minutes</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Warm Standby</td><td>Minutes</td><td>Seconds</td><td>Medium ($$$)</td><td>Medium-High</td><td>Business-critical apps. Faster RTO needed</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Active/Passive</td><td>Minutes</td><td>&lt;1 sec</td><td>High ($$$$)</td><td>High</td><td>Mission-critical. Financial systems. Low RPO required</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Active/Active</td><td>Seconds</td><td>Near-zero</td><td>Highest ($$$$$)</td><td>Highest</td><td>No downtime acceptable. Global users. Banking, e-commerce</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-07-sap-c02-dr-decision-tree.svg\" alt=\"SAP-C02 DR decision tree\" width=\"548\" height=\"727\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:548px;max-width:548px\"></figure>\n\n  <h4>Real-World DR — Banking Application</h4>\n  <figure class=\"dgfig awsfig\"><img class=\"aws-img\" src=\"/images/aws-sap/sap-s10-08-banking-active-passive-dr-architecture.svg\" alt=\"Banking active/passive DR architecture\" width=\"682\" height=\"739\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"min-width:640px;max-width:682px\"></figure>\n\n  <h2 id=\"exam-tips\">8. Exam Tips &amp; Cheat Sheet</h2>\n  <div class=\"exam-box\">\n    <h4>SAP-C02 HA &amp; DR — Critical Points</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>RTO vs RPO:</strong> RTO = how long can we be down? RPO = how much data can we lose?</li>\n      <li><strong>Backup &amp; Restore:</strong> Cheapest. Slowest (hours). Snapshots stored cross-region.</li>\n      <li><strong>Pilot Light:</strong> DB replica running, EC2 not running. Fast DB recovery, slow app recovery.</li>\n      <li><strong>Warm Standby:</strong> Scaled-down copy running in DR. Scale up on disaster. Minutes RTO.</li>\n      <li><strong>Active/Passive:</strong> Full capacity in DR, Route 53 failover routing. Minutes RTO with Aurora Global.</li>\n      <li><strong>Active/Active:</strong> Both regions serve traffic. Route 53 latency/weighted routing. DynamoDB Global Tables (multi-active writes). Near-zero RTO/RPO.</li>\n      <li><strong>Aurora Global Database:</strong> RPO ~1 sec, RTO ~1 min. Best for active/passive cross-region.</li>\n      <li><strong>DynamoDB Global Tables:</strong> Multi-active. Any region can write. Use for active/active.</li>\n      <li><strong>Route 53 Failover:</strong> Health checks detect failure. TTL affects switchover speed — use low TTL (30-60 sec) for DR.</li>\n      <li><strong>AWS Backup Vault Lock:</strong> WORM backups — even admins can't delete. For compliance.</li>\n      <li><strong>RDS Read Replica promotion:</strong> Manual action required. Plan DR procedure and automate it.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cheat-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cheat-card\">\n      <h5>DR Strategy Summary</h5>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Backup: Hours RTO/RPO, cheapest</li>\n        <li>Pilot Light: 10-60min RTO, DB running</li>\n        <li>Warm Standby: minutes RTO, scaled-down</li>\n        <li>Active/Passive: min RTO, full DR region</li>\n        <li>Active/Active: seconds RTO, both live</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cheat-card\">\n      <h5>Key DR Services</h5>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Aurora Global: RPO &lt;1s, RTO &lt;1min</li>\n        <li>DynamoDB Global Tables: multi-active</li>\n        <li>Route 53 Failover: automatic routing</li>\n        <li>S3 CRR: async object replication</li>\n        <li>AWS Backup: centralized snapshots</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cheat-card\">\n      <h5>HA Patterns</h5>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Multi-AZ = AZ-level HA</li>\n        <li>Multi-Region = Region-level HA</li>\n        <li>Auto Scaling = compute HA</li>\n        <li>ALB health checks = traffic HA</li>\n        <li>RDS Multi-AZ = DB AZ-level HA</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cheat-card\">\n      <h5>RPO/RTO Quick Math</h5>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Daily backup = RPO up to 24 hours</li>\n        <li>Hourly backup = RPO up to 1 hour</li>\n        <li>Async replication = RPO minutes</li>\n        <li>Aurora Global = RPO &lt;1 second</li>\n        <li>Manual restore = RTO hours</li>\n        <li>Route 53 failover = RTO minutes</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
